<p>Is the deduction rule valid?</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p>Yes, because there is a row in which both premises are true.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>No, because the columns for the two premises are not identical.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Yes, in every row where both premises are true, the conclusion is also true.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>No, because the premises are never both true in the same row.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Impossible to determine without more information.</p>
</li>
</var></p>
